=== layout: one-panel

# 31. GM Mosquitos

@body

- Talk about GM mosquitos and their role with malaria and Zika virus.
- How do we prevent the GM mosquitos from spreading?
- What types of GM mosquitos have been released in the world to date?
- What is the future of GM mosquitos hold?
- Do mosquitos have any ecological importances?

@notes

Source: ../old/lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 101.
