=== layout: two-panels

# 31. Gene drive: a 2018 cage experiment

@left

- A gene drive targeted the doublesex gene.
- Females with two disrupted copies had altered development and were sterile.
- This was a contained laboratory study.

[Kyrou et al., 2018](https://www.nature.com/articles/nbt.4245)

@right

