=== layout: one-panel

# 31. Three different strategies

@body

| Strategy | What happens? | Key distinction |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Self-limiting transgene | Released males pass a harmful trait | Usually requires continued releases |
| Wolbachia | A bacterial symbiont changes reproduction or transmission | Not insertion of a mosquito transgene |
| Gene drive | Biased inheritance can spread an alteration | Potential persistence and spread |

@notes

2026 topic 31; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
