# Topic 32: Trendy mice

=== layout: one-panel

# Topic 32: Trendy mice

@body

- Marathon mouse. Mighty mouse. Fierce mouse. Smart mouse. Which one is your favorite?
- Each nickname points to an experiment involving a particular gene and a particular set of measurements.
- An impressive trait may come with other changes we did not ask for.
- Before applying the result to people, ask what the experiment actually showed in mice.

@notes

