=== layout: two-panels

# 32. Trendy transgenic mice

@left

- *Marathon Mouse* – can run about 1800 meters, has enhanced PPAR-delta gene
- *Mighty Mouse* – was engineered to lack myostatin, a protein that slows muscle growth.
- *Fierce Mouse* – has both copies of the NR2E1 gene deleted and shows abnormal aggression
- *Smart Mouse* – improved learning and memory, extra copies of the NR2B gene

@right

![Slide image 82](assets/lect06c-set_4_tp_chapter_12_16_material/image_082.png)

@notes

Source: ../old/lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 112.
