=== layout: one-panel

# 32. Transgenic mice as research models

@body

- Alter genes to investigate their biological functions.
- Compare the resulting traits with appropriate controls.
- One classical method injects DNA into a fertilized egg nucleus.
- The original "52 disease genes" count is a historical example, not a current inventory.

@notes

Source: ../old/lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 113.
Converted layout or wording reviewed against the original slide. Original text and import diagnostics are retained in the review evidence.
