=== layout: one-panel

# 32. Would it work in a person?

@body

- Which modification would you choose, if any? Explain its mechanism and possible costs.
- Does more muscle mean better endurance? Does success on a learning test mean greater intelligence in every situation?
- What would change when the alteration is made in an adult rather than during development?
- When should sports organizations test or regulate genetic enhancement? Use the biology to explain the practical and ethical problems.

@notes

