# 33. GMO salmon: approval and a business

@left

![AquAdvantage salmon comparison from the original lecture](assets/lect06c-set_4_tp_chapter_12_16_material/image_090.png)

@right

- 2015: FDA approved AquAdvantage salmon.
- AquaBounty's 2025 annual report records the sale of its Canadian farms and salmon IP in March 2025.
- That report lists no operating salmon farms for AquaBounty.
- Does regulatory approval tell you who is producing or selling the fish today?

@notes

Source: ../old/lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 119.
