# 33. Modern Turkeys

@left

- Modern commercial turkey is a triumph of [*selective breeding*]{underline=true} over the limitations imposed by physiology
- Desire for gigantic turkey breasts leads to impotence
  - The giant breasts we enjoy are too large to allow a male to effectively mount a hen.

